				<wikidot:authorName>Doctor GE Smith</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1786409</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is the first -J that I've read that really runs with the idea that researchers write -Js up in setting as a way to blow off steam. This is kinda funny, but it also provides a nice human snapshot of over-stressed life inside the SCP.<br /> I mean, I'm often a bit of a slob, but in an SCP facility, I'd sterilize EVERYTHING!<br /> +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
